 <h3><u>Bade badon se bada hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Husain ka asghar<br> bade bado se bada hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>husainiyat ki baqa hai husain ka asghar<br> bade bado se bada hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>1. Ghuroor karti thi jis hurmala pe fauj e yazeed..(2)<br> usi pe rann me hasa hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>2. Jo maangna hai to jhule ki simt aa jao..(2)<br> ameer e karbobala hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>3. Kabhi shaoor ki ankho se padh kitaab e atash..(2)<br> waraq waraq pe likha hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>4. Qadam utha nahi paya magar yazeed tere..(2)<br> qadam ukhaad gaya hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>5. Bilaal ab meri qaamat ko kaun naapega..(2)<br> meri jabee pe likha hai husain ka asghar</p> 
  <p>bade bado se bada hai husain ka asghar</p> 
